  "format": "Four drafters build baseball-movie rosters across six categories: drama, comedy, kids, high concept, based on a true story, and a wild card loose enough to cover anything with a baseball in it. The argument running under it all is what even counts as a baseball movie. Chris Ryan and Mallory Rubin join for the picks.",
  "segments": [
